;;     6. `cast.carp`        — Lumi-Drill, Projectiles, Power Spells, Triggers & Staves
;;     7. `satchel.carp`     — [Tab] Dual-Strip Workbench & 64-Pocket (8x8) Satchel
;;     8. `update.carp`      — Steering, Swept Collisions, GPU Pack & Frame Loop
;; =============================================================================

